        model: '“Start from the problem, not from the big picture. Two trains: do they have many dependencies, do they build one system together? Then a Solution Train helps. Is the problem that your budgets are stuck per project? Then the portfolio layer helps. If you have neither, Essential SAFe is enough, and you can expand later. Ask the consultancy which concrete problem each layer solves here.”',
